{"thread":{"threadID":2283,"boardID":58,"topic":"Wut Bann ?","time":1427530028,"userID":1551,"username":"DocDrecksTinte","lastPostTime":1427751168,"lastPoster":"Marxn","replies":11,"views":838,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":22861,"threadID":2283,"userID":1551,"username":"DocDrecksTinte","subject":"Wut Bann ?","time":1427530028,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Beleidigung, mehrfache Bans zuvor das stand da why wurde ich gebannt ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22862,"threadID":2283,"userID":1658,"username":"StepZ","subject":"","time":1427537100,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich weiß es nicht zu 100%, aber ich vermute wegen Beleidigung. Denn dies steht ja auch dort. Außerdem bist du schon mehrmals negativ aufgefallen, deswegen ist diesmal der Ban vermutlich etwas länger ausgefallen.<br>Mfg</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22863,"threadID":2283,"userID":1589,"username":"thehashmash","subject":"","time":1427537313,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo, der Admin der dich gebannt hat hat dazu geschrieben das du einen anderen Spieler beleidigt hast also müsstest du Ja einen Spieler auf dem Server Beleidigt haben. Sonst geh doch auf den Teamspeak3 Server und frag da nach!:)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>LG hashi</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22864,"threadID":2283,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1427537823,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo DocDrecksTinte,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>du hast mich gestern mit deinem Satz beleidigt und dies habe ich dann DeadLineRusher weitergeleitet und er hat dann mit Equinox gesprochen wie lang und somit kam es zu einem 2 Wochen Ban, weil du beleidigt hast und du jetzt dein 10. Ban hast. Equinox hat dich gebannt, weil DeadLineRusher dich nicht Bannen konnte aus welchem Grund, weiß ich nicht.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22926,"threadID":2283,"userID":1551,"username":"DocDrecksTinte","subject":"","time":1427655737,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>wie hab ich dich beleidigt ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22927,"threadID":2283,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1427658086,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Solltest du Wissen, weil du hast es ja getan, also Beweise wurde DeadLineRusher vorgezeigt und mehr sag ich jetzt nicht dazu.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22958,"threadID":2283,"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","subject":"","time":1427740243,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>11 Ban <span class=\"missing-media\">[neinnein*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22959,"threadID":2283,"userID":1551,"username":"DocDrecksTinte","subject":"","time":1427746671,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>normal wird noch mehr</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22960,"threadID":2283,"userID":1589,"username":"thehashmash","subject":"","time":1427748605,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schlechte Einstellung... <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👎</span> <span class=\"missing-media\">[dieregeln*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22961,"threadID":2283,"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","subject":"","time":1427749294,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Als wenn es selbstverständliche wäre für dich, ganz schön dreist, sich so zu verhalten. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span><br><br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22962,"threadID":2283,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1427749940,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>normaler Weise hättest du bei anderen Communitys schon ein Perma Ban und für diese Aussage haste erst Recht ein Perma Ban verdient!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":22963,"threadID":2283,"userID":1445,"username":"Marxn","subject":"","time":1427751168,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dein Ban bleibt bestehen.<br>Du musst dich echt ändern, <br>wenn es so weiter geht kommt wirklich der Perma Ban.<br>Also lerne aus deine Fehlern.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thema wird geschlossen da es zu keinen Ende führt.<br>Lg. FREAK<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[closesnew*]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}